<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Dickson Const shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Dickson Const shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction and civil engineering group Dickson Construction International Ltd was suspended at company request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
